000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RPTNEXT.
000300* NEXT PAGE in its forms: a REPORT HEADING with NEXT GROUP NEXT
000400* PAGE has the first page to itself; a detail with LINE n NEXT
000500* PAGE starts a page whenever a body group is already on one
000600* (rule 3c); a detail with NEXT GROUP NEXT PAGE leaves
000700* LINE-COUNTER at FOOTING (6c); a REPORT FOOTING with LINE n NEXT
000800* PAGE ends on a page of its own.
